WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.570
You know, it's been almost a year

00:00:01.570 --> 00:00:03.740
since our staff started working remotely.

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:06.110
I really miss seeing
everyone around the office.

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:08.360
So I'm gonna check in with some staffers

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:09.960
who are working from home

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:13.684
and see what's new since
the last time I saw them.

00:00:13.684 --> 00:00:15.050
[Together] Hi, Conan.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:16.760
Hey Diane, what's new with you?

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:18.970
Well, I got a PhD in astrophysics

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:21.432
and I'm currently manning the Mars rover.

00:00:21.432 --> 00:00:24.550
Perseverance, collect the geology samples.

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:25.740
Oh, that's cool.

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:26.900
What about you, Chris?

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:29.645
We bought a zoo and our
elephant just gave birth.

00:00:29.645 --> 00:00:30.940
(elephant trumpeting)

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:31.773
Oh okay.

00:00:31.773 --> 00:00:33.410
What about you Kathy?

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:34.433
I got a tattoo.

00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:38.320
That's nice.

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.260
That's all you're gonna say?

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:42.500
I guess, so many things have
happened in the last year

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.920
that nothing really surprises me anymore.

00:00:44.920 --> 00:00:46.930
I bet I can surprise you, Conan.

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:49.510
Jake from State Farm?

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:51.100
I'm here to tell you
about surprisingly great

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:52.954
rates from State Farm.

00:00:52.954 --> 00:00:55.120
How can we compete with that?

00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:58.853
Jake, how great are these
surprisingly great rates?

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:01.829
Check your inbox.

00:01:01.829 --> 00:01:03.450
(phone notification beeping)

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:05.210
Are you kidding me?

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:07.810
I'm so surprised by these great rates.

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:09.030
These rates are unbelievable.

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:12.920
I'm losing my mind over these great rates!

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:16.000
Jake from State Farm, you did it again!

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.579
Yeah, Jake really did do it again.

00:01:18.579 --> 00:01:21.329
(Conan laughing)

